1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Ninth Episode
The Broken Idols

15
00:02:03,061 --> 00:02:05,621
Sapphire gave me an
appointment in the castle.

16
00:02:06,621 --> 00:02:09,340
Here is the place he was
talking about! Right below me!

17
00:02:22,821 --> 00:02:26,257
That construction looks
like a gallows. Strange...

18
00:02:30,141 --> 00:02:33,053
What is a gallows doing
in this castle?

19
00:02:33,101 --> 00:02:35,217
And all those people
lined up down there?

20
00:02:35,501 --> 00:02:37,298
What does all this mean?

21
00:02:50,901 --> 00:02:53,256
Has Prince Sapphire
not arrived yet?

22
00:02:53,301 --> 00:02:55,895
- No, I'm not putting it on!
- But you have to put it on!

23
00:02:55,941 --> 00:02:59,650
It's for the ceremony! It's the
costume for the visit to the sacred idols!

24
00:02:59,701 --> 00:03:01,692
- Everyone has one!
- Put it on!

25
00:03:01,741 --> 00:03:04,130
The sacred idols
have always protected us!

26
00:03:04,181 --> 00:03:07,173
- We must thank them!
- Yes, that's right!

27
00:03:07,421 --> 00:03:09,412
If I wear it, will you give me...

28
00:03:10,501 --> 00:03:12,890
...something to eat?
I've been fasting.

29
00:03:12,941 --> 00:03:14,579
I'm sorry, Prince.

30
00:03:14,621 --> 00:03:17,089
So now you will give me
something to eat, I hope.

31
00:03:17,221 --> 00:03:19,735
Of course, immediately! Here it is!

32
00:03:20,021 --> 00:03:21,818
And what would this be?

33
00:03:21,861 --> 00:03:24,011
Stale bread.
Whoever eats it today,

34
00:03:24,061 --> 00:03:26,211
will be blessed and happy
all year long.

35
00:03:26,261 --> 00:03:28,013
Ah, I see

36
00:03:31,381 --> 00:03:34,373
It's tradition that on this day
nothing else is eaten.

37
00:03:35,901 --> 00:03:39,689
The same tradition dictates that
you don't take more than a bite of it.

38
00:03:39,741 --> 00:03:41,618
Well, it's time to get moving.

39
00:03:46,461 --> 00:03:50,170
Your Majesty, we have brought you
His Highness Prince Sapphire.

40
00:03:50,221 --> 00:03:52,098
Where is the Prince? I don't see him.

41
00:03:52,141 --> 00:03:54,450
You're right!
The Prince is gone!

42
00:03:54,501 --> 00:03:56,617
Idiots!
We cannot begin

43
00:03:56,661 --> 00:03:59,414
the ceremony in honor of the sacred
idols without Prince Sapphire,

44
00:03:59,461 --> 00:04:02,214
- so run and look for him!
- I'm coming!

45
00:04:02,781 --> 00:04:05,659
- That sounds like my son's voice.
- Yes, it was Sapphire!

46
00:04:07,621 --> 00:04:09,930
Good morning, beloved parents.

47
00:04:10,141 --> 00:04:13,019
Oh, no! What have you done
with your costume?

48
00:04:13,061 --> 00:04:14,619
Why?

49
00:04:26,781 --> 00:04:28,533
How funny!

50
00:04:29,221 --> 00:04:31,132
Stop laughing!

51
00:04:31,261 --> 00:04:34,810
With that funny outfit,
he looks like a scarecrow!

52
00:04:37,141 --> 00:04:39,814
Sapphire, be polite
and stop laughing!

53
00:04:39,861 --> 00:04:42,136
I'm sorry, Mom.
I couldn't help it.

54
00:04:47,181 --> 00:04:49,172
The program
of today's ceremony...

55
00:04:49,221 --> 00:04:51,655
...includes entering the tower
in which are kept...

56
00:04:51,701 --> 00:04:53,817
...the images
of the ancestors of the idols,

57
00:04:53,861 --> 00:04:56,329
to pay them homage
and clean them of dust!

58
00:05:36,141 --> 00:05:37,813
Are you all ready?

59
00:05:48,421 --> 00:05:51,652
Now we will enter this
sacred place only one at a time.

60
00:05:51,821 --> 00:05:53,413
I'll go in first!

61
00:05:54,021 --> 00:05:56,012
Good heavens, how high it is!

62
00:05:58,501 --> 00:06:01,334
You will climb to the very top, to the place
assigned to each of you,

63
00:06:01,381 --> 00:06:03,451
and you will set yourselves
patiently to work!

64
00:06:10,581 --> 00:06:13,414
And what is this? From its appearance
it looks like it's a doll.

65
00:06:13,460 --> 00:06:15,133
What a funny face it has!

66
00:06:15,180 --> 00:06:18,139
Don't touch it!
Get away from there immediately!

67
00:06:18,660 --> 00:06:20,891
It is sacrilege
to touch the sacred idols!

68
00:06:20,940 --> 00:06:23,409
it is sacrilege to mock
the images! Sacrilege!

69
00:06:24,260 --> 00:06:26,570
Nylon, tell them
to open the windows!

70
00:06:26,620 --> 00:06:30,295
Women, now open the
windows and start cleaning! Clear?

71
00:06:38,820 --> 00:06:41,892
- What is this, father?
- It is the sovereign idol.

72
00:06:41,940 --> 00:06:44,171
The idol that was
erected by our ancestors...

73
00:06:44,220 --> 00:06:47,133
...to keep evil spirits
away from our land!

74
00:06:47,180 --> 00:06:48,819
It's imposing!

75
00:06:53,540 --> 00:06:57,011
Stupid, don't look down
or the height will scare you!

76
00:06:57,180 --> 00:06:59,012
Maybe she has vertigo!

77
00:07:09,100 --> 00:07:11,092
An idol is falling!

78
00:07:12,580 --> 00:07:14,253
Watch out!

79
00:07:14,300 --> 00:07:17,418
The idol will break!
The curse will fall upon us!

80
00:07:17,620 --> 00:07:19,612
Let's get out of here!

81
00:07:27,020 --> 00:07:29,899
Sapphire! It must have been smashed to pieces!

82
00:07:30,020 --> 00:07:33,616
Thank heaven, you are safe! And you
managed to save the idol too!

83
00:07:33,660 --> 00:07:35,572
Fool!

84
00:07:35,620 --> 00:07:39,057
Do you know what punishment is received by
someone who risks breaking an idol?

85
00:07:39,420 --> 00:07:42,652
Yes... Our law says
that whoever drops an idol...

86
00:07:42,700 --> 00:07:45,010
..or causes its face to be broken
will have their face cut.

87
00:07:45,100 --> 00:07:48,571
If they cause an arm or a
leg to be broken, they will have theirs cut off too!

88
00:07:49,020 --> 00:07:53,219
And finally... if they cause the head to be broken,
they will be hanged!

89
00:07:53,260 --> 00:07:55,900
Well said! Even the daughters
of noblemen, like you,

90
00:07:55,940 --> 00:07:57,818
can be punished!

91
00:07:57,860 --> 00:08:00,614
Don't be so harsh!
After all, the idol didn't break!

92
00:08:00,660 --> 00:08:03,175
I don't know how to thank you
for saving the idol.

93
00:08:03,220 --> 00:08:05,018
Now I will put it back in its place.
Give it here!

94
00:08:05,300 --> 00:08:07,212
Here, take it!

95
00:08:17,900 --> 00:08:20,369
Thank goodness...!
All's well that ends well.

96
00:08:21,580 --> 00:08:23,697
You take care of them, Nylon.

97
00:08:23,740 --> 00:08:26,016
- Yes, Sire.
- Who is coming?

98
00:08:26,340 --> 00:08:27,899
It's Tink!

99
00:08:29,100 --> 00:08:33,060
I'm really curious to see
what's in that strange building.

100
00:08:37,820 --> 00:08:39,652
I didn't want to scare you!

101
00:08:42,300 --> 00:08:44,815
Good heavens! The idol is falling!

102
00:08:46,621 --> 00:08:48,612
Oh, no!

103
00:08:57,021 --> 00:08:59,489
Who was it?! Come on, say it!

104
00:09:01,701 --> 00:09:05,091
And don't faint over so little, ugh!

105
00:09:05,141 --> 00:09:07,018
So, who was it?

106
00:09:07,061 --> 00:09:09,291
It was all my fault,
Baron Nylon!

107
00:09:16,701 --> 00:09:18,453
Come on, bring him here!

108
00:09:18,501 --> 00:09:20,173
- Right away, Grand Duke!
- No! No! No!

109
00:09:20,221 --> 00:09:22,894
Please! Let me go! No! No!

110
00:09:24,061 --> 00:09:26,575
Majesty, your seal will
be enough on this Order...

111
00:09:26,621 --> 00:09:29,089
...and we will proceed
immediately to the execution.

112
00:09:29,141 --> 00:09:31,496
My heart breaks
to execute a child,

113
00:09:31,541 --> 00:09:33,736
but even if it's hard,
the law is the law.

114
00:09:44,781 --> 00:09:48,171
- Who is this hothead?
- But it's His Highness!

115
00:09:49,541 --> 00:09:51,497
What do you want to do with Tink!

116
00:09:51,821 --> 00:09:55,655
Do you mean that young rascal
who is to be executed?

117
00:09:55,701 --> 00:09:58,818
- Executed?! - Unfortunately, he has
committed a major crime,

118
00:09:58,861 --> 00:10:01,819
by breaking one of our idols.
Now he must pay with his life.

119
00:10:01,981 --> 00:10:03,733
But that is terrible!

120
00:10:10,221 --> 00:10:11,813
Tink, you

121
00:10:12,221 --> 00:10:14,132
Damn it, get away!

122
00:10:34,421 --> 00:10:36,616
What are you doing, Your Highness? Have you gone mad?

123
00:10:36,661 --> 00:10:38,174
Let go of me!

124
00:10:38,621 --> 00:10:42,409
I must put an end to this
superstition or others will die!

125
00:10:59,541 --> 00:11:02,101
There, now I feel much better.

126
00:11:04,221 --> 00:11:07,816
What? Have they broken other idols?
What a sacrilegious act!

127
00:11:07,861 --> 00:11:10,694
Right! Therefore, Sire,
you must sign...

128
00:11:10,741 --> 00:11:13,335
...for the immediate execution
of the culprit.

129
00:11:14,821 --> 00:11:17,096
You sign for me.
I am sleepy.

130
00:11:18,021 --> 00:11:19,693
As you wish!

131
00:11:19,741 --> 00:11:22,050
It's time for my bed to be prepared

132
00:11:22,221 --> 00:11:24,212
At your command, Majesty

133
00:11:32,141 --> 00:11:34,257
- Duralumin!
- Yes, Sire?

134
00:11:35,141 --> 00:11:38,895
What do you say if we passed a
law to abolish the death penalty?

135
00:11:38,941 --> 00:11:41,455
It is not a good idea, Your Majesty.
Have you considered...

136
00:11:41,501 --> 00:11:44,652
...that if we do not punish those
who break the sacred idols,

137
00:11:44,701 --> 00:11:47,010
the evil spirits
will curse us...

138
00:11:47,061 --> 00:11:50,019
...and fill your kingdom
with misfortune and death?

139
00:11:50,061 --> 00:11:52,700
My goodness! I don't want
such a thing to happen!

140
00:11:52,741 --> 00:11:55,619
That's better! Begin!

141
00:12:14,421 --> 00:12:16,491
I will be hanged from the tower!

142
00:12:26,421 --> 00:12:28,412
But that is my son Sapphire!

143
00:12:28,461 --> 00:12:30,053
Goodbye, dear parents!

144
00:12:30,101 --> 00:12:32,251
Duralumin!
What the devil have you done?

145
00:12:32,301 --> 00:12:35,816
Why should my daughter... I
mean, my son be executed?

146
00:12:36,021 --> 00:12:39,411
This is the death
warrant with your seal!

147
00:12:39,461 --> 00:12:41,691
His Highness has broken 30 idols!

148
00:12:43,381 --> 00:12:45,895
Oh, my Sapphire! What have you done?

149
00:12:45,941 --> 00:12:48,694
Why? Why did you
want to break our laws...

150
00:12:48,741 --> 00:12:50,891
...and commit such a sacrilege?

151
00:12:51,021 --> 00:12:53,012
Sapphire!

152
00:12:53,741 --> 00:12:57,211
Forgive me, mother! I
didn't want to make you cry!

153
00:13:00,021 --> 00:13:03,650
Damn it! If only I
could untie myself!

154
00:13:05,221 --> 00:13:08,770
Sire, we will soon begin
the execution of the verdict.

155
00:13:44,221 --> 00:13:47,816
- Such a good boy!
- Sapphire!

156
00:13:51,861 --> 00:13:54,694
Sapphire! Sapphire, no! Sapphire!

157
00:13:54,741 --> 00:13:57,096
Stop!
The law forbids you to go!

158
00:13:57,141 --> 00:13:59,336
Nylon, let me pass,
please!

159
00:13:59,381 --> 00:14:01,417
You cannot go up the tower!

160
00:14:04,901 --> 00:14:07,335
Forgive me, Your Highness, I am
forced to do my duty.

161
00:14:07,381 --> 00:14:09,019
Do you really want to hang him, dad?

162
00:14:10,221 --> 00:14:12,018
You know, I feel very sorry for him.

163
00:14:12,741 --> 00:14:15,414
Shut up! Watch, instead,
and learn how it's done.

164
00:14:15,501 --> 00:14:18,459
Tink, are you glad
that we will go to Heaven together?

165
00:14:19,661 --> 00:14:21,891
Come on, my son!
Pass me the rope!

166
00:14:25,181 --> 00:14:27,570
- Please, Prince, escape!
- Thank you!

167
00:14:28,221 --> 00:14:30,576
Prince Sapphire has freed himself!

168
00:14:34,221 --> 00:14:37,293
Your Majesty, Prince Sapphire
has rebelled!

169
00:14:37,341 --> 00:14:39,411
- Damn it!
- Did you hear?

170
00:14:39,461 --> 00:14:41,850
- Our son Sapphire!
- It's true, our son...

171
00:14:41,901 --> 00:14:45,257
- He will not escape his punishment!
- But I...!

172
00:14:45,301 --> 00:14:47,337
Prince Sapphire, now,
is an outlaw,

173
00:14:47,381 --> 00:14:49,656
so shoot arrows at him
and kill him!

174
00:14:49,701 --> 00:14:51,612
No, Duralumin! Not this!

175
00:14:51,661 --> 00:14:54,539
What do you think? That the life
of the Prince is more important...

176
00:14:54,581 --> 00:14:56,651
...or the existence of Silverland?

177
00:15:00,141 --> 00:15:01,893
Hurry, Sapphire!

178
00:15:03,501 --> 00:15:06,413
Too late!
I can't make it anymore!

179
00:15:14,901 --> 00:15:17,335
Prince, it is useless for you
to rebel against your destiny!

180
00:15:17,381 --> 00:15:19,815
Your parents will not be left
with a good memory of you...

181
00:15:19,861 --> 00:15:21,817
..if you perish as a rebel!

182
00:15:21,901 --> 00:15:24,176
You want to see me
dead, Baron Nylon, huh?

183
00:15:24,221 --> 00:15:26,098
But I won't let you win,
this time!

184
00:15:26,141 --> 00:15:27,813
Look!

185
00:15:28,821 --> 00:15:32,097
- Let's help Prince Sapphire!
- Let's help him!

186
00:15:36,901 --> 00:15:39,574
Who is that scoundrel who dares
to destroy the last sacred idols?

187
00:15:46,221 --> 00:15:49,418
Courage! Courage, Sapphire!

188
00:15:49,901 --> 00:15:52,131
Farewell, my dear parents..!

189
00:15:52,861 --> 00:15:56,251
Let's go help Sapphire!
Let's do as he does!

190
00:15:56,301 --> 00:15:58,895
We absolutely must do
something! Let's help him!

191
00:15:58,941 --> 00:16:01,899
Let's help Sapphire!
We must help him!

192
00:16:01,941 --> 00:16:03,533
What's happening? Speak!

193
00:16:03,581 --> 00:16:06,254
A crowd of women is
rushing at the sacred idols.

194
00:16:06,301 --> 00:16:08,451
They say they want
to help the Prince!

195
00:16:08,541 --> 00:16:10,736
I cannot allow
such a thing!

196
00:16:10,781 --> 00:16:13,011
Go home, wife,
or I'll lose my job!

197
00:16:13,061 --> 00:16:16,417
Do you think just because you earn a few measly coins, you can order me around?

198
00:16:16,461 --> 00:16:18,099
But dear...!

199
00:16:24,261 --> 00:16:27,173
Good job! You did well!
Let's break everything!

200
00:16:34,301 --> 00:16:36,292
Women, please, stop!

201
00:16:36,341 --> 00:16:39,014
Get your hands off me! That'll
teach you to touch a lady!

202
00:16:43,581 --> 00:16:45,492
Damned breed of savages!

203
00:16:45,541 --> 00:16:48,578
Stop the execution and
arrest these frantic women!

204
00:17:03,021 --> 00:17:06,013
The women have proven
to be smarter than the men!

205
00:17:06,061 --> 00:17:08,814
How can stones
drive away evil spirits?

206
00:17:11,141 --> 00:17:17,091
Now that we are imprisoned,
we don't care at all..

207
00:17:17,141 --> 00:17:22,659
..about foolish traditions!
We will regain our freedom!

208
00:17:22,901 --> 00:17:28,259
Now that we are already
condemned, we all remain happy!

209
00:17:28,301 --> 00:17:34,297
And with the fallen
idols superstition will fall!

210
00:17:38,741 --> 00:17:40,732
A lesson must be taught here!

211
00:17:40,781 --> 00:17:44,057
One of them will go to the gallows!
What do you say? Am I doing the right thing?

212
00:17:48,341 --> 00:17:50,013
It's Mephisto!

213
00:17:50,461 --> 00:17:52,736
- Hail, Mephisto!
- Duralumin!

214
00:17:52,781 --> 00:17:56,137
You tried to kill Sapphire
without my permission.

215
00:17:56,221 --> 00:17:59,896
I will only forgive you if you get me
her heart! Understood?

216
00:18:00,181 --> 00:18:03,298
Forgive me, Mephisto!
All right, I will give it to you!

217
00:18:03,341 --> 00:18:05,332
I cannot get close to Sapphire

218
00:18:05,381 --> 00:18:07,258
because she always has that angel
in the way!

219
00:18:07,301 --> 00:18:09,098
Make sure he is left alone!

220
00:18:09,141 --> 00:18:12,577
All right, as you wish!
I will only let him out of the cell.

221
00:18:13,741 --> 00:18:15,413
That's fine.

222
00:18:18,061 --> 00:18:20,211
Well? What's new now?

223
00:18:20,261 --> 00:18:22,491
Follow me, Your Highness.
The King wishes to see you.

224
00:18:22,541 --> 00:18:25,897
- All right, take me to him.
- What do you think he wants to tell you, Sapphire?

225
00:18:25,941 --> 00:18:28,694
It could be a good sign:
maybe he will grant me a pardon.

226
00:18:45,421 --> 00:18:47,218
But then it's a trap!

227
00:18:49,141 --> 00:18:51,416
This time you won't succeed
in escaping, Prince.

228
00:18:51,461 --> 00:18:53,736
You will end up being hanged,
so resign yourself...

229
00:18:53,781 --> 00:18:55,533
..and put down that sword!

230
00:18:55,581 --> 00:18:57,856
Then come and get it,
if you can!

231
00:19:00,341 --> 00:19:03,572
Go get him and try
to make up for it, after that fiasco of yours!

232
00:19:06,501 --> 00:19:08,856
Halt!
I'm sorry, Prince,

233
00:19:08,901 --> 00:19:11,813
but I must complete my
work, so let yourself be captured!

234
00:19:11,861 --> 00:19:14,136
You don't want to?
Then it will be worse for you!

235
00:19:32,101 --> 00:19:34,171
What... What a strange wind!

236
00:19:34,421 --> 00:19:36,252
It's lifting me up!

237
00:19:59,021 --> 00:20:02,411
I did it! This must be
the devil's work!

238
00:20:10,421 --> 00:20:13,538
What kind of cloud is this?!
I get it, it's Mephisto!

239
00:20:14,021 --> 00:20:16,012
Perhaps the time has come
to step out.

240
00:20:17,661 --> 00:20:19,652
All too easy!

241
00:20:20,021 --> 00:20:22,694
It is useless for you to
try to escape your destiny!

242
00:20:22,741 --> 00:20:25,460
You won't get away
with it, Prince Sapphire!

243
00:20:25,501 --> 00:20:28,379
Finally I will be able to
tear out your male heart!

244
00:20:34,901 --> 00:20:36,539
It's fantastic!

245
00:20:36,581 --> 00:20:39,857
You won't dare fight
Mephisto! You wouldn't make it!

246
00:20:44,141 --> 00:20:46,780
Mephisto is hurling
the stone idols at me!

247
00:20:59,541 --> 00:21:01,532
I surrender, Mephisto!

248
00:21:01,581 --> 00:21:04,812
I see with pleasure that you
have come to wiser counsel!

249
00:21:04,861 --> 00:21:08,331
Even if I take one heart from
you, you will still have the other!

250
00:21:11,021 --> 00:21:13,216
Damn, the chain is stiff!

251
00:21:18,021 --> 00:21:19,739
Take this!

252
00:21:27,101 --> 00:21:28,898
Damn it!

253
00:21:29,141 --> 00:21:32,019
It's over for you!
You cannot make me succumb!

254
00:21:32,061 --> 00:21:34,700
- Stop fighting me!
- Never!

255
00:21:34,741 --> 00:21:37,096
- Even if you're right...
- Now...

256
00:21:37,581 --> 00:21:39,412
...stare at me.

257
00:21:45,381 --> 00:21:47,656
Go back to hell
and don't make me angry!

258
00:21:47,701 --> 00:21:50,261
Otherwise I will make you suffer
the most excruciating pain...

259
00:21:50,301 --> 00:21:52,257
...that you have ever felt!
Understood?

260
00:21:52,301 --> 00:21:54,690
All right,
but don't get any closer than that!

261
00:21:56,021 --> 00:21:59,491
Get lost right now or I'll jump on you
and make you feel my hands!

262
00:21:59,621 --> 00:22:02,010
Okay, I'm leaving!
But stay where you are!

263
00:22:02,061 --> 00:22:04,211
I feel my body weakening!

264
00:22:18,101 --> 00:22:20,012
Sapphire is safe!

265
00:22:20,901 --> 00:22:22,892
Yeah, he's safe!

266
00:22:26,101 --> 00:22:29,298
I'm glad you're safe!
But why are you crying?

267
00:22:30,021 --> 00:22:32,819
I'm sorry
for causing you so much pain!

268
00:22:33,421 --> 00:22:36,015
Mom, I won't cause you any more!

269
00:22:36,621 --> 00:22:39,738
But I'm glad
I destroyed the idols.

270
00:22:44,581 --> 00:22:46,731
- What is he here to do?
- What does he want?

271
00:22:50,781 --> 00:22:53,614
Well! You've had enough fun,
haven't you?

272
00:22:53,661 --> 00:22:55,253
Well, you see, we...

273
00:22:55,701 --> 00:22:58,693
You must have realized that Mephisto
is the only evil spirit,

274
00:22:58,741 --> 00:23:02,814
So you must be convinced that
those idols were completely useless!

275
00:23:03,021 --> 00:23:06,616
Isn't it funny to have believed for
so long in the power of those stones?

276
00:23:07,261 --> 00:23:10,810
And you must also have seen that the
devil cannot be defeated with stones!

277
00:23:10,861 --> 00:23:13,011
Doesn't this make you laugh, Grand Duke?

278
00:23:13,061 --> 00:23:15,291
I wish I could sink into
the ground! Like this!

279
00:23:46,021 --> 00:23:49,252
It takes very little to
defeat superstitions!

280
00:24:08,660 --> 00:24:12,280
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

281
00:24:12,281 --> 00:24:15,641
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

282
